{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And on the eighth day.</b> And similarly <b>every male</b> among you — whoever is of your seed, whether born in the house or bought with silver, and you Abraham shall circumcise those born in your house and bought with your money today, even if they are adults."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {0 "The lemma 'ימול לכם' is rendered from context as 'And on the eighth day,' following the verse; the Hebrew text as given appears compressed, with the lemma head and body flowing together without clear separation."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:51.720613747Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}